<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="admin-shell"><%- include('../partials/admin-nav') %><main class="admin-main" id="main-content"><% const adminTitle = 'Configurações'; %><%- include('../partials/admin-top', { adminTitle }) %><%- include('../partials/flash') %><div class="admin-settings-grid"><form class="admin-panel settings-form" action="/admin/configuracoes" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">MARCA</span><h2>IDENTIDADE E CONTATO</h2></div></div><label>Slogan<input name="brand_slogan" value="<%= settings.brand_slogan || '' %>"></label><label>E-mail de suporte<input name="support_email" type="email" value="<%= settings.support_email || '' %>"></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Instagram<input name="instagram_url" type="url" value="<%= settings.instagram_url || '' %>" placeholder="https://instagram.com/suamarca"></label><label>Facebook<input name="facebook_url" type="url" value="<%= settings.facebook_url || '' %>"></label><label>TikTok<input name="tiktok_url" type="url" value="<%= settings.tiktok_url || '' %>"></label><label>WhatsApp<input name="whatsapp_url" type="url" value="<%= settings.whatsapp_url || '' %>" placeholder="https://wa.me/55..."></label></div><div class="panel-heading inner-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHECKOUT</span><h2>DADOS PIX</h2></div></div><label>Beneficiário<input name="pix_beneficiary" value="<%= settings.pix_beneficiary || '' %>"></label><label>Chave Pix<input name="pix_key" value="<%= settings.pix_key || '' %>"></label><label>Instruções ao cliente<textarea name="pix_instructions" rows="4"><%= settings.pix_instructions || '' %></textarea></label><div class="panel-heading inner-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">FRETE</span><h2>POLÍTICA DE ENTREGA</h2></div></div><label>Modo de frete<select name="shipping_mode"><option value="manual" <%= (settings.shipping_mode || 'manual') === 'manual' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Calcular depois do pedido</option><option value="flat" <%= settings.shipping_mode === 'flat' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Valor fixo no checkout</option></select><small>Para cotação automática de transportadoras, veja o README e configure uma integração externa posteriormente.</small></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Frete fixo (R$)<input name="shipping_flat_rate" inputmode="decimal" value="<%= settings.shipping_flat_rate || '0' %>" placeholder="19,90"></label><label>Frete grátis acima de (R$)<input name="shipping_free_over" inputmode="decimal" value="<%= settings.shipping_free_over || '0' %>" placeholder="299,90"></label><label>CEP de origem (opcional)<input name="shipping_origin_zip" value="<%= settings.shipping_origin_zip || '' %>" placeholder="00000-000"></label></div><button type="submit" class="button button-primary">SALVAR CONFIGURAÇÕES ↗</button></form><form class="admin-panel goal-form" action="/admin/metas" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">OBJETIVO</span><h2>META DO MÊS</h2></div></div><p class="muted">Esta meta é usada no painel principal para acompanhar o faturamento em pedidos.</p><label>Nome da meta<input name="title" value="<%= goal ? goal.title : 'Meta de faturamento mensal' %>"></label><label>Meta (R$)<input name="target" inputmode="decimal" value="<%= goal ? (goal.target_cents / 100).toFixed(2).replace('.', ',') : '20000,00' %>"></label><button class="button button-outline" type="submit">ATUALIZAR META</button><div class="settings-note"><strong>Servidor local</strong><p>Antes da primeira publicação, preencha a chave Pix e os links oficiais. Mantenha cópias de segurança de <code>data/neblk.db</code> e <code>public/uploads</code>.</p></div></form><form class="admin-panel goal-form" action="/admin/senha" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SEGURANÇA</span><h2>ALTERAR SENHA ADMIN</h2></div></div><label>Senha atual<input name="current_password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><label>Nova senha<input name="new_password" type="password" minlength="10" required autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Mínimo de 10 caracteres"></label><button class="button button-outline" type="submit">ATUALIZAR SENHA</button></form></div></main><%- include('../partials/admin-end') %>
